<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap split--even split">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Pink Fish</h2>
      <p>Processors in Kudawella sell under their own brand, <strong>Pink Fish: Women Crafting Ocean Treasures</strong>, through the Ruhunu Shakthi organisation. The range includes dried fish, karawala sambol, Maldive fish chips, ambul thiyal and curry cubes, sold at local fairs.</p>
      <p>Adding value this way lets processors earn more from the same catch and sell beyond the landing site.</p>
    </div>
